---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/editions.css';
import catalog from '../data/edition-catalog.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" title="Private Editions Editor">
 <section class="editions">
  <span class="eyebrow">Studio administration</span><h1>Editions Editor</h1><p class="intro">Manage acquisition prices, collector invitations and the studio mailing list.</p><p id="status" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <form id="login" class="panel"><h2>Studio sign-in</h2><p class="small">Use a GitHub access token belonging to ClaytonTalmon, with access to the website repository. The token is used once to verify your identity, then discarded. Your studio session lasts eight hours.</p><label>GitHub access token<input name="token" type="password" autocomplete="off" required /></label><button class="primary">Open the editor</button></form>
  <div id="studio" hidden>
   <button id="logout">Sign out</button>
   <section class="panel" style="margin-top:30px"><h2>Acquisition prices</h2><p class="small">Select a photograph and format. Prices apply to pairs of numbered prints: 1–2, 3–4, and so on. The next available print’s price updates automatically when you change the number sold. Artist’s proofs remain on enquiry. Blank prices display “Price on enquiry”.</p>
    <div class="toolbar"><label>Photograph<select id="work"></select></label><label>Format<select id="format"></select></label></div>
    <form id="pricing"><p id="size-summary" class="small"></p><div class="toolbar"><label>Currency<select id="currency"><option>USD</option><option>EUR</option><option>GBP</option><option>CHF</option></select></label><label>Number sold<input id="sold" type="number" min="0" step="1" required /></label></div><div id="bands"></div><p id="next-price" class="small"></p><button class="primary">Save prices and availability</button></form>
    <p id="missing" class="small" hidden>Set this work’s print dimensions and edition count in the Collection Editor first, then publish the collection. Its formats will appear here after the website rebuilds.</p>
   </section>
   <section class="panel" style="margin-top:40px"><h2>Collector requests</h2><p class="small">“Approve &amp; email password” sends a unique invitation lasting 24 hours from issue. Reissuing invalidates the previous invitation. Revocation also ends existing collector sessions.</p><button id="refresh">Refresh requests</button><div id="requests"></div></section>
   <section class="panel" style="margin-top:40px"><h2>Mailing list</h2><p class="small">Only confirmed subscribers are included in exports. Remove a subscriber when they ask to leave the list. This editor does not send campaigns.</p><button id="export">Export confirmed subscribers</button><div id="subscribers"></div></section>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="catalog" set:html={JSON.stringify(catalog).replace(/</g,'\\u003c')} />
 </section>
</BaseLayout>
<script>import '../scripts/editions-editor.js';</script>
